<|start|>assistant to=user<|message|># 副簽
(pos:名詞/動詞)
<explanation>
yue:喺文件、支票等上面除咗正簽名之外，再由另一人或者上司簽名作確認。動詞用法即係做呢個動作。（量詞：個、次）
eng:to countersign / co-sign; a countersignature
<eg>
yue:呢張支票要副簽先至可以過數。 (nei1 zoeng1 zi1 cai2 jiu3 fuk6 ceon1 sin1 zi3 ho2 gwo3 sou3.)
eng:This cheque needs to be countersigned before it can be cashed. [end of text]


